        <li class="muted">Retrosynthesis requires a server-side API key and is implemented here as a call to `/api/retrosynth` — implement that endpoint in your Node/Express proxy to call ASKCOS/AiZynth/PostEra.</li>
        <li class="muted">Pathway enrichment uses Reactome and KEGG public endpoints. For heavy usage, cache results server-side.</li>
